OL,3,GNEWSAStudents across South West
OL,4,Areceiving GCSE results
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe wait is over for thousands of
OL,7,Fstudents across the South West who are
OL,8,Freceiving their GCSE or equivalent
OL,9,Fresults.
OL,11,FPupils can collect their results from
OL,12,Fschool, while some also have the option
OL,13,Fto access them on their phone after the
OL,14,Flaunch of a government education app.
OL,16,FStaff will be on hand at schools and
OL,17,Fcolleges throughout Devon and Cornwall
OL,18,Fto celebrate success and support
OL,19,Fstudents who do not do as well as they
OL,20,Fhoped, teachers said.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
